        <item>
            <title>0.15.19</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 10:19:27 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>180</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.19</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>A recording interrupted by a crash, a forced quit, or an app update is no longer lost. Whatever was captured up to the interruption is now recovered and transcribed automatically on the next launch. Previously the interrupted file&#x27;s header was never finalized, so it read as empty (zero length) and got discarded even though the audio was sitting on disk.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
